  "details": "I would like if the SDK had a drop down for commonly used \"custom\" Collision tags, for example having things like Ice, Fire, Water, ect. \n\nI have had a few cases people have neat intractables on their avatar that in theory could and honestly should interact with one another but our tags dont match. In an example someone had a candle that could be lit using the tag \"Flame\" But the sparks off my scythe use the tag \"Fire\" and another friends fireball spell used the tag \"Blaze\" In theory my fire starter as well as their magic system should of lit the candle but it cannot due to mismatched tags.\n\nMy proposal would just have a commonly used drop down in the custom tag setting or such that has a list of \"common\" tags which would be more generic tags that you can use to increase the chances your avatars can have interactions with others.",
